---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Service Areas
permalink: /service-areas/
description: "Your Name Screen & Enclosure serves Orange, Seminole, Osceola, and Lake counties in Central Florida — pool enclosures, screen rooms, and rescreening across Orlando, Winter Park, Kissimmee, Lake Mary, and more."
---

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Service Areas</span>
      </nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">Service Areas</span>
      <h1>Screen Enclosures Across {{ site.areaServed }}</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Based in {{ site.city }} and serving four counties — if you're in the greater Orlando metro, we come to you for free estimates and permitted enclosure work.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="map-embed">
        <iframe
          src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Orlando+FL&t=&z=9&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed"
          width="100%"
          height="480"
          style="border:0;"
          allowfullscreen=""
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          title="Service area map — Central Florida">
        </iframe>
      </div>

      <div class="county-grid">
        {%- for county in areas.counties %}
        <div class="county-card">
          <h3>{{ county.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ county.cities | join(", ") }}</p>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="callout center">
        <h3>Don't see your town?</h3>
        <p>We cover most of the greater Orlando area. If you're nearby, give us a call — chances are we serve your neighborhood.</p>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
